{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124161509291-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124163434\"/><p>小童由家人抱住送院救治。</p><p>今午(24日)3時05分，一名年約一歲半小童與家人，乘搭昂坪360纜車由昂坪前往東涌途中，小童突然失去知覺及陷入昏迷。政府飛行服務隊派出直升機飛至彌勒山轉向站，把該小童及其家人吊起，送往東區醫院救治。據了解，小童接受人工呼吸急救後，抵達醫院時回復清醒，其昏迷原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:02.806370+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:15:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:17.308994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:17.308994+00:00","content_hash":"064e6d39bbcc93cc2b9bb67d8be9a6faebf306e7eda04e35d8f7680e9b0285d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}